# Video Player Fix4 — Debugging Notes & Resolution

**Date:** 2026-05-25
**Branch:** `fix4` (commit `a1fad39`)
**Status:** Smooth playback confirmed on Raspberry Pi 4 (eLinux)

---

## Problem Statement

Live HLS playback on a Raspberry Pi 4 running Flutter eLinux was producing:
- Choppy / freeze-then-jump video
- Audio/video desync
- (Previously) blank video output after switching to hardware decode

The app is a Flutter-based live TV STB (soatv) consuming HLS streams.

